@startuml
title Proposed body mutation: commit before display
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
hide footbox
participant ":MainWindow" as UI
participant ":LogicManager" as Logic
participant ":BodyLogCommand" as Cmd
participant ":Model" as Model
participant ":Storage" as Storage
UI -> Logic: execute(commandText)
Logic -> Model: getAddressBook()
Model --> Logic: current address-book state
Logic -> Logic: snapshot = new AddressBook(state)
note over Logic, Cmd: Parsing validates raw fields; omitted here.
Logic -> Cmd: execute(model)
Cmd -> Model: getFilteredPersonList()
Model --> Cmd: currently displayed clients
Cmd -> Cmd: resolve target; validate complete candidate
alt invalid state / duplicate
  Cmd --> Logic: CommandException
  Logic --> UI: error; no display request
else valid candidate
  Cmd -> Model: setPerson(target, updated)
  Cmd --> Logic: result with updated-target view request
  Logic -> Storage: saveAddressBook(updated state)
  alt save succeeds
    Storage --> Logic: committed
    Logic --> UI: CommandResult
    UI -> UI: select target; refresh body sections
  else IOException
    Storage --> Logic: IOException
    Logic -> Model: setAddressBook(snapshot)
    Logic --> UI: body-save CommandException
    note right of UI: Do not display rejected candidate.
  end
end
@enduml
